\begin_layout Section*
The Likelihood
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
If we consider a Gaussian PDF we get the following likelihood function :x
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathcal{L}=\prod_{i}\frac{1}{2\pi\sigma_{w}\sigma_{z}}\exp\left(\frac{z_{i}^{2}}{2\sigma_{z}^{2}}+\frac{w_{i}^{2}}{2\sigma_{w}^{2}}\right)
\]

\end_inset


\end_layout

